## Title: AKForeverBags
## Notes: Puts the reagent bag's slots into the combined bag window's own grid, right after the normal slots, each with a slot background in another colour. The slots stay Blizzard's own: using, dragging, splitting, selling, searching and sorting work as ever. The bag buttons (backpack, bag slots, key ring) dock under the bag window, with a fold arrow.
